Package: tired
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, systemd (>= 249), sudo
Recommends: dbus-user-session, libpam-systemd
Description: persistent systemd service creation and management
 Turns an existing foreground command into an understandable persistent systemd
 service. Provides an interactive review, declarative application profiles,
 headless operation, journal inspection and checked transaction recovery.
 Generated services operate independently of this package and survive
 its removal.
